nequality. \n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing must be the following:\n\n![](images/13/1368ee41963c1abcc320d2cd35449c08599582f37c7d68f750e137fcdcd2e57b.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281354 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "042e4157-bfc2-5a27-a5f2-30fa623a1739" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c2/c244350524a52123e2e97db4cd8eb4f57737b8b15746eb72a8d54eac32a4f3cf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278625} {:answer/id #uuid "194e22f8-8fb9-57e0-b1f3-883c6f1f3c27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c5/c501e7e341af57e86f18d73871314800d453f79572e16ccf2477335352d4dcdc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278813} {:answer/id #uuid "78185cb7-fed8-5728-84d4-f9c34d0ceb1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9c/9cd254ac65dedfa4c720b18afd4f5c3c7676b4f21170930f78e9adac276317ee.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279663} {:answer/id #uuid "a94b4a1e-0ac2-5b32-aa1a-639dcba8fbfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/13/1368ee41963c1abcc320d2cd35449c08599582f37c7d68f750e137fcdcd2e57b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186280095} {:answer/id #uuid "e67d90ab-d605-56d8-af8e-7db9618ee656" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d477a9f312fc2fb0a5a4c2d13164c96118aa70b53cf23db80be9ec698151e6fd.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186280624}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "194e22f8-8fb9-57e0-b1f3-883c6f1f3c27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c5/c501e7e341af57e86f18d73871314800d453f79572e16ccf2477335352d4dcdc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278813} :answer-field/id #uuid "c65b41f9-3939-501e-8345-1125734187f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186281181}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "553ab218-87bf-5c6a-b2ae-3d3c054a906a" :question/math-academy-id "q-161843" :question/problem "Which of the following shows the region in the $uv$-plane where the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}4u+{v}^{2} \\\\ v-{u}^{2}\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nis (locally) orientation-preserving?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that a transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving at the points where the Jacobian determinant is positive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}>0.\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}4u+{v}^{2} \\\\ v-{u}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 2v \\\\ -2u & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot 1-(-2u)\\cdot (2v) \\\\  & =4+4uv.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the required regions, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4+4uv & >0 \\\\ 4uv & >-4 \\\\ uv & >-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis gives the solution $v>-\\frac{1}{u}$ for $u>0$ and $v<-\\frac{1}{u}$ for $u<0.$\n\nNotice that the equation \n\n$$\nv=-\\frac{1}{u}\n$$\n\ndefines a hyperbola, and the coordinates of, say, $(1,1)$ and $(-1,-1)$ satisfy the inequality. \n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving must be the following:\n\n  \n\n![](images/c5/c501e7e341af57e86f18d73871314800d453f79572e16ccf2477335352d4dcdc.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281360 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e3e495a-4d39-5ca6-b3be-a0813078a0db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/fe/fe7bb422a3f992ea88a900e63b2c55df99bce3a785929901c248abadfadf23f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278868} {:answer/id #uuid "a23d32b3-d4d4-5e82-8301-ae2d3c9a6002" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/61/613e83ce5ad615490