\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v{e}^{uv} & u{e}^{uv} \\\\ 2u & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =v{e}^{uv}\\cdot (1)-(2u)\\cdot u{e}^{uv} \\\\  & ={e}^{uv}(v-2{u}^{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the required regions, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{uv}(v-2{u}^{2}) & >0 \\\\ v-2{u}^{2} & >0 \\\\ v & >2{u}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNotice that the equation \n\n$$\nv=2{u}^{2}\n$$\n\ndefines a parabola, and the coordinates of, say, $(0,1)$ satisfy the inequality. \n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving must be the following:\n\n![](images/61/613e83ce5ad6154905ec9001ece078309e396561e251e85455ff261bb4cd61a0.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186383547 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d480733d-2bef-5e70-8bd1-b1ffc7f1c3fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/42/427cb4b8e6497f75aecfe809aa084b0bf6f4ad167f3a0838aa40b1a50d115e1d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383549} {:answer/id #uuid "c32a224b-bb0d-59ed-877d-57206e5e909b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d477a9f312fc2fb0a5a4c2d13164c96118aa70b53cf23db80be9ec698151e6fd.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383550} {:answer/id #uuid "ecaf9992-c899-5cf7-95ad-9660ca75dce5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/fe/fe7bb422a3f992ea88a900e63b2c55df99bce3a785929901c248abadfadf23f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383551} {:answer/id #uuid "153ff83b-ae84-5113-a031-ffd9105e29be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/30/3033f0ae73e3f484fc5d3d65e388062feba1824fb3da9971d560cf2f518f49bb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383552} {:answer/id #uuid "c24435eb-c7ff-5866-926c-e388c2da1faf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0b/0b764651dbc7999e7af13214685796b5045fab89f1